 커널 스레","words":[{"text":"다대일(many-to-one)","x":336,"y":1082,"width":346,"height":43},{"text":"모델(그림","x":700,"y":1081,"width":144,"height":41},{"text":"4.7)은","x":863,"y":1083,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"많은","x":977,"y":1083,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"사용자","x":1061,"y":1083,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"수준","x":1180,"y":1085,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"스레드를","x":1264,"y":1085,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"하나의","x":1416,"y":1084,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"커널","x":1536,"y":1084,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"스레","x":1618,"y":1086,"width":65,"height":36}]},{"text":"亡루 사상한다. 스레드 관리는 사용자 공간의 스레드 라이브러리에 의해 행해진다. 따라","words":[{"text":"亡루","x":339,"y":1149,"width":59,"height":28},{"text":"사상한다.","x":416,"y":1145,"width":143,"height":37},{"text":"스레드","x":576,"y":1145,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"관리는","x":690,"y":1145,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"사용자","x":806,"y":1146,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"공간의","x":922,"y":1146,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"스레드","x":1040,"y":1146,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"라이브러리에","x":1160,"y":1146,"width":199,"height":38},{"text":"의해","x":1377,"y":1147,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"행해진다.","x":1459,"y":1146,"width":144,"height":37},{"text":"따라","x":1619,"y":1148,"width":69,"height":37}]},{"text":"서 효율적이라 할 수 있다(스레드 라이브러리에 대해서는 4.4절에서 논의한다). 하지만,","words":[{"text":"서","x":336,"y":1209,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"효율적이라","x":384,"y":1208,"width":170,"height":37},{"text":"할","x":568,"y":1208,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":615,"y":1208,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"있다(스레드","x":666,"y":1208,"width":182,"height":40},{"text":"라이브러리에","x":863,"y":1208,"width":203,"height":38},{"text":"대해서는","x":1085,"y":1208,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"4.4절에서","x":1234,"y":1208,"width":149,"height":38},{"text":"논의한다).","x":1401,"y":1209,"width":158,"height":39},{"text":"하지만,","x":1576,"y":1209,"width":111,"height":39}]},{"text":"한 스레드가 봉쇄형 시스템 콜을 할 경우, 전체 프로세스가 봉쇄된다. 또한, 한 번에 하나","words":[{"text":"한","x":335,"y":1272,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"스레드가","x":381,"y":1271,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"봉쇄형","x":529,"y":1270,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"시스템","x":644,"y":1270,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"콜을","x":758,"y":1272,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"할","x":838,"y":1272,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"경우,","x":888,"y":1272,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"전체","x":977,"y":1272,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1058,"y":1272,"width":173,"height":37},{"text":"봉쇄된다.","x":1242,"y":1271,"width":145,"height":37},{"text":"또한,","x":1401,"y":1272,"width":77,"height":37},{"text":"한","x":1492,"y":1272,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"번에","x":1539,"y":1272,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"하나","x":1619,"y":1272,"width":69,"height":39}]},{"text":"의 스레드만이 커널에 접근할 수 있기 때문에, 다중 스레드가 다중 코어 시스템에서 병","words":[{"text":"의","x":336,"y":1334,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"스레드만이","x":384,"y":1333,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"커널에","x":571,"y":1333,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"접근할","x":688,"y":1333,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":803,"y":1335,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"있기","x":855,"y":1335,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"때문에,","x":937,"y":1335,"width":111,"height":37},{"text":"다중","x":1065,"y":1335,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"스레드가","x":1149,"y":1334,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"다중","x":1302,"y":1334,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"코어","x":1384,"y":1334,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"시스템에서","x":1468,"y":1334,"width":166,"height":39},{"text":"병","x":1656,"y":1337,"width":27,"height":37}]},{"text":"별로 실행될 수 없다. 그린 스레드(green thread)가 다대일 모델을 사용하였는데, 그린","words":[{"text":"별로","x":337,"y":1397,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"실행될","x":417,"y":1396,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":532,"y":1397,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"없다.","x":582,"y":1396,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"그린","x":671,"y":1397,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"스레드(green","x":752,"y":1397,"width":215,"height":44},{"text":"thread)가","x":982,"y":1397,"width":164,"height":40},{"text":"다대일","x":1160,"y":1397,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"모델을","x":1274,"y":1397,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"사용하였는데,","x":1390,"y":1397,"width":213,"height":39},{"text":"그린","x":1618,"y":1400,"width":69,"height":36}]},{"text":"스레드는 Solaris 시스템을 위한 스레드 라이브러리를 말하며 Java의 초기 버전에서도","words":[{"text":"스레드는","x":336,"y":1460,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"Solaris","x":485,"y":1462,"width":116,"height":31},{"text":"시스템을","x":618,"y":1460,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"위한","x":770,"y":1460,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"스레드","x":852,"y":1460,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"라이브러리를","x":971,"y":1460,"width":208,"height":38},{"text":"말하며","x":1193,"y":1460,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"Java의","x":1307,"y":1459,"width":107,"height":41},{"text":"초기","x":1432,"y":1461,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"버전에서도","x":1518,"y":1461,"width":170,"height":39}]},{"text":"채택되었다. 그러나 다중 처리 코어가 대부분의 컴퓨터 시스템에서 표준이 되었고 다중","words":[{"text":"채택되었다.","x":337,"y":1523,"width":176,"height":39},{"text":"그러나","x":530,"y":1523,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"다중","x":647,"y":1523,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"처리","x":731,"y":1523,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"코어가","x":812,"y":1524,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"대부분의","x":931,"y":1524,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":1084,"y":1524,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"시스템에서","x":1201,"y":1523,"width":165,"height":37},{"text":"표준이","x":1385,"y":1524,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"되었고","x":1502,"y":1524,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"다중","x":1619,"y":1526,"width":69,"height":37}]},{"text":"처리 코어의 이점을 살릴 수 없기 때문에 이 모델을 중인 시스템은 거의 존재하지","words":[{"text":"처리","x":339,"y":1587,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"코어의","x":419,"y":1587,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"이점을","x":537,"y":1586,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"살릴","x":651,"y":1587,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":734,"y":1587,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"없기","x":786,"y":1586,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"때문에","x":